DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The rrkkccoommpphhyy driver controls the combo PIPE PHY integrated on Rockchip
     RK3566/RK3568 and RK3588 SoCs.  The PHY supports the PCIe 2.0 (2.5 GT/s
     and 5 GT/s), USB 3.0 (5 Gbps), SATA (1.5 Gbit/s, 3 Gbit/s and 6 Gbit/s)
     and QSGMII (1.25 Gbit/s and 5 Gbit/s) protocols.  The rrkkccoommpphhyy driver
     does not implement support for QSGMII.

